<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.75in">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">(ii)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">On June 26, 2023, the Company granted 6,668 stock options to a consultant of the Company. The 4,668 options are exercisable at CAD$16.8
per share and the 2,000 options are exercisable at CAD$24.0 per share. The options expire on June 26, 2033.</TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

